# Realtek rtw88 firmware for ICS-OS

File: `rtw8821c_fw.bin` (RTL8821CE / 8821C)

Source: linux-firmware `rtw88/rtw8821c_fw.bin`
Licence: Redistributable. See linux-firmware WHENCE entry for rtw88 and
`LICENCE.rtlwifi_firmware.txt` in the linux-firmware project.

Placed on the boot ESP as `/icsos/firmware/rtw88/rtw8821c_fw.bin` when
`base/` is staged into the image (`make usb-etcher`).
